       }
      ],
      "text": "Axillary n. supply:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " deltoid and teres minor; the glenohumeral joint; skin over the deltoid (S. lat cutaneous n. of the arm)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
