      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Musculocutaneous n. supply:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " coracobrachialis, biceps brachii and brachialis; the shoulder and elbow joints; skin of the lat forearm."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
