      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Median n. course in the arm:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " lat to the axillary a., then down b/n biceps brachii and triceps brachii, crossing the brachial a. from lat to medial; in the cubital fossa it lies medial to the brachial a. and the biceps tendon."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
