        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Carpal tunnel signs:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " radial-palmar hand paresthesias and wrist and palm pain (may radiate to the forearm and shoulder, may be worse @ night); later sensory loss over the palmar first 3 fingers and weak, atrophied thumb abduction and opposition."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
