       }
      ],
      "text": "Ulnar n. course in the arm:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " medial to the axillary and brachial arteries, thru the medial intermuscular septum (arcade of Struthers) into the posterior compartment, then behind the medial epicondyle in the cubital tunnel."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
