       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Ulnar n. motor supply:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " flexor carpi ulnaris, medial ½ of flexor digitorum profundus, the hypothenar muscles, 3rd and 4th lumbricals, palmar and dorsal interossei, deep head of flexor pollicis brevis, adductor pollicis and palmaris brevis."
     }
    ]
   },
