       }
      ],
      "text": "Ulnar compress @ the elbow:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " paresthesias and sensory loss in the fifth digit and medial ½ of the fourth; weak, possibly atrophied thumb adductor, fifth-digit abductor and interosseous muscles."
     }
    ]
   },
